Z||000008||BBBAD GT||07-05-2000||09:47 AM||||Haze:  <P>You should know better that any that a bone stock V6 Fiero on its best day couldn't beat a bone stock 5.0, both with 5 speeds.  If you do the calcualtions, 92 mph at 3000lb is around 180 HP.  (2700 lb to 3100lb is 160HP to 185 HP).  I'm not bashing Fieros, just trying to be realistic here.<P><P>------------------<BR>87 GT, Stock for now<BR><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT's Web Site</A>||||reg||1
